@ Filterable, filter, partition, reject

~ "Logical" not
~ "Setoid" equal
~ "Ord" lt

.. filter keeps values the quotation accepts.
.. partition leaves the matches below and the rest on top.
.. filterMap keeps Some. partitionMap leaves Right below and Left on top.
& Filterable f
  .. Values the quotation accepts.
  filter ( (f a) (a -- Bool) -- (f a) )
  .. Matches below, the rest on top.
  partition ( (f a) (a -- Bool) -- (f a) (f a) )

: reject ( Filterable f => (f a) (a -- Bool) -- (f a) )
  [ call not ] cons filter


. ..................................................................................................

# Filterable Array
  filter = filter_array
  partition = partition_array

: foreign filter_array ( a. (Array a) (a -- Bool) -- (Array a) )
: foreign partition_array ( a. (Array a) (a -- Bool) -- (Array a) (Array a) )

? "filter" < < 0n > > [ < 0n 2n > [ 1n lt ] filter ]
? "partition" < < 0n > < 2n > > [ < 0n 2n > [ 1n lt ] partition ]
? "reject" < < 1 3 > > [ < 1 2 3 > [ 2 equal ] reject ]
